<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" kicker="Privacy" description="How Dreemy AI Guide handles visits and personal information on this static independent publication."><h2>Summary</h2><p>This is a static editorial website. It has no user accounts, character chats, prompt box, image or video generator, subscription checkout, or visitor profile database.</p><h2>Technical request data</h2><p>Our hosting and security provider may process standard request data such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamp, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>No roleplay or media collection</h2><p>We do not accept or store Dreemy AI messages, prompts, account credentials, generated media, or private images. Do not send sensitive data through public correction channels.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Links to Dreemy AI and other referenced services lead to third-party sites governed by their own privacy terms. Review those policies before registering, chatting, uploading media, or paying.</p></InfoPage>
